&lt;p data-path-to-node="25,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="25,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Ecosystem &amp;amp; Security&lt;/strong&gt;: In-depth knowledge of &lt;strong data-path-to-node="25,2,0" data-index-in-node="44"&gt;Firebase&lt;/strong&gt;, REST APIs, and security standards (OAuth).&lt;/p&gt;
